@startuml
title CommU Interact

hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Human
participant "CommU" as Commu
participant "Gemini Live 3.8 API" as Gemini
participant "HuBERT\nSpeech-to-Motion" as Hubert

Human -> Commu: Human Speech
Commu -> Gemini: Human Speech
Gemini -> Hubert: Response speech

Hubert -> Hubert: 14 joints angles
Hubert --> Commu: Response speech + 14 joints angles

Commu --> Human: Response speech + motion


@enduml
